<https://example.org/ontology/holding#usesMetric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "部門採用某項指標衡量業務狀況；不因此決定承作子公司、來源資料權責、理專歸屬或自動加總方式。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#usesMetric> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "金控"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
