<https://example.org/ontology/holding#incomePeriodStart> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "手收所屬收入期間的開始日期；不預設按日、月或年衡量。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#incomePeriodStart> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "金控"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#lumMeasuresProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LUM 衡量金融商品"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#lumMeasuresProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "LUM 衡量其所對應金融商品之放款或融通餘額。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#lumMeasuresProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "金控"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#LUM> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LUM"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#LUM> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "衡量指定基準日納入業務管理範圍之放款或融通餘額的指標；具體涵蓋與認列口徑由子公司或部門描述，不以擔保品估值或未動用額度代替。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#LUM> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "金控"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
