<https://example.org/ontology/bank#LoanProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "銀行依授信安排提供客戶使用資金的融資商品；不以放款餘額直接認定為 AUM。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#LoanProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "子公司"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
