<https://example.org/ontology/bank#PlannedTrustProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "本專案依金融商品口徑分類之規劃型信託業務，依信託目的與契約安排管理或運用客戶財產；私銀實際涵蓋的一般信託與員工持股信託範圍由部門描述。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#PlannedTrustProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "子公司"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#PlannedTrustProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#subsidiary> "銀行"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#Department> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "部門"@zh-TW .
