<https://example.org/ontology/bank#BondProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "發行人為籌資而發行、約定清償條件的債務型金融商品。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#BondProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "子公司"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#BondProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#subsidiary> "銀行"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#aumAsOfDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AUM 基準日"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#aumAsOfDate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "AUM 所衡量資產規模對應的日期；具體選日規則由子公司或部門描述。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#aumAsOfDate> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "金控"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#FeeIncome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "手收指標"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#FeeIncome> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "衡量指定收入期間內依業務認列口徑歸入手收的收入指標；具體涵蓋範圍由子公司或部門描述。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#FeeIncome> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "金控"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#feeBaseAmount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "手收計算基礎金額"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#feeBaseAmount> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "適用手收計算情境中作為輸入的收入金額；具體組成與來源由子公司或部門描述。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#feeBaseAmount> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "金控"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#countryCode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "國家／地區代碼"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#countryCode> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "地址所屬國家或地區的代碼。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#countryCode> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "金控"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "名稱"@zh-TW .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "類別或屬性的顯示名稱。"@zh-TW .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "金控"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#metricAmount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "指標金額"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#metricAmount> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "量化業務指標的結果金額，包含 AUM、LUM、手收與利收；具體計算與認列口徑由子公司或部門描述。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#metricAmount> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "金控"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#StructuredFinancialProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "結構型金融商品"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#StructuredFinancialProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "依商品契約將金融工具組合，形成特定收益或風險條件的金融商品。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#StructuredFinancialProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "子公司"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#StructuredFinancialProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#subsidiary> "證券"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#OverseasFinancialProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "海外金融商品"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#OverseasFinancialProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "證券業務中歸入海外投資範圍的金融商品。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#OverseasFinancialProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "子公司"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#OverseasFinancialProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#subsidiary> "證券"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#FundProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "基金商品"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#FundProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "透過集合投資方式，由專業管理機構依基金契約管理運用資產的金融商品。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#FundProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "子公司"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/securities#FundProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#subsidiary> "證券"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#TWDFinancialProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "台幣金融商品"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#TWDFinancialProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "以新臺幣計價的金融商品。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#TWDFinancialProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "子公司"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#TWDFinancialProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#subsidiary> "銀行"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#CollectiveManagementProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "銀行集合管理投資商品"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#CollectiveManagementProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "銀行依信託約定，將營運範圍或方法相同的信託資金集合管理運用的投資商品；私銀實際涵蓋範圍由部門描述。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#CollectiveManagementProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "子公司"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#CollectiveManagementProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#subsidiary> "銀行"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#MobileContactInformation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "手機通聯資訊"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#MobileContactInformation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "以手機號碼聯絡客戶的通聯資訊。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/holding#MobileContactInformation> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "金控"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#ETFProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "銀行 ETF 商品"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#ETFProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "客戶透過銀行通路交易或持有的 ETF 商品；私銀實際涵蓋範圍由部門描述。"@zh-TW .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#ETFProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#governanceLevel> "子公司"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://example.org/ontology/bank#ETFProduct> <https://example.org/ontology/holding#subsidiary> "銀行"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
